   "bank_id": "FATHER",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-single-clip",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line02",
   "vo_ref": "FATHER/FATHER[admitted-single-clip]",
   "emotion": "solemn",
   "text": "长虹，记住——牛市没有眼泪。",
   "est_sec": 3.3,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L05",
   "shot_n": 5,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "十年，我背熟了这座城市的每一根 K 线。",
   "est_sec": 4.0,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L06a",
   "shot_n": 6,
   "speaker_role": "MINOR:GATEKEEPER",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:MINOR:GATEKEEPER(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "扫地的不进大厅。",
   "est_sec": 1.9,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": [
    "auto-split-heuristic"
   ]
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L06b",
   "shot_n": 6,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "我只要一个能看见大屏的位置。",
   "est_sec": 3.3,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": [
    "auto-split-heuristic"
   ]
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L07",
   "shot_n": 7,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "父亲的笔记本，第一页只有一句话——盘口会说谎，成交量不会。",
   "est_sec": 5.8,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L09",
   "shot_n": 9,
   "speaker_role": "MINOR:RETAILER-A",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:MINOR:RETAILER-A(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "urgent",
   "text": "跌了跌了！全跌了！",
   "est_sec": 2.1,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L10",
   "shot_n": 10,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "tense",
   "text": "不对……这不是跌，是洗盘。",
   "est_sec": 3.1,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L11",
   "shot_n": 11,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "恐慌，是庄家最好的烟幕。",
   "est_sec": 2.4,
   "shot_window_s": 5,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L12",
   "shot_n": 12,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "panic",
   "text": "完了！我全仓啊！全部身家！",
   "est_sec": 3.1,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L13",
   "shot_n": 13,
   "speaker_role": "CH+MANCANG",
   "bank_id": [
    "CH",
    "MANCANG"
   ],
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted+admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": [
    "ep003_line19",
    "ep001_line12"
   ],
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted] / MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "question",
   "text": "全仓？全仓！……命大。",
   "est_sec": 2.6,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": [
    "needs-manual-split"
   ]
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L14",
   "shot_n": 14,
   "speaker_role": "MINOR:CROWD",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:MINOR:CROWD(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "urgent",
   "text": "拉了！！",
   "est_sec": 1.0,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L15",
   "shot_n": 15,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "股神……你是股神！",
   "est_sec": 2.1,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L17",
   "shot_n": 17,
   "speaker_role": "XIONG",
   "bank_id": "XIONG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line06",
   "vo_ref": "XIONG/XIONG[admitted]",
   "emotion": "tense",
   "text": "这个眼神……我在哪见过。",
   "est_sec": 2.9,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L18",
   "shot_n": 18,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "父亲，我回来了。",
   "est_sec": 1.6,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L19",
   "shot_n": 19,
   "speaker_role": "XIONG",
   "bank_id": "XIONG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line06",
   "vo_ref": "XIONG/XIONG[admitted]",
   "emotion": "question",
   "text": "小伙子，今天三个点，你是蒙的，还是算的？",
   "est_sec": 4.8,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L20",
   "shot_n": 20,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "家传的。",
   "est_sec": 1.0,
   "shot_window_s": 2,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L21",
   "shot_n": 21,
   "speaker_role": "XIONG",
   "bank_id": "XIONG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line06",
   "vo_ref": "XIONG/XIONG[admitted]",
   "emotion": "cold",
   "text": "欢迎回到联华。",
   "est_sec": 1.7,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP001-L22",
   "shot_n": 22,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "熊市没有眼泪。牛市也没有。",
   "est_sec": 2.6,
   "shot_window_s": 2,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L01",
   "shot_n": 1,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "在联华，我扫了三个月的地，也记了三个月的盘。",
   "est_sec": 4.4,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L02",
   "shot_n": 2,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "联华实业，今天挂牌上市。",
   "est_sec": 2.4,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L03",
   "shot_n": 3,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "股神！我找你三天了！",
   "est_sec": 2.4,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L04",
   "shot_n": 4,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "question",
   "text": "我在上班。你到底想干嘛？",
   "est_sec": 2.9,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L06",
   "shot_n": 6,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "我不拿别人的血汗钱。",
   "est_sec": 2.4,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L07",
   "shot_n": 7,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "十万，全给你！条件——带我发财！",
   "est_sec": 3.8,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L08",
   "shot_n": 8,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "好。但我有条件——亏了别哭。",
   "est_sec": 3.3,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L09",
   "shot_n": 9,
   "speaker_role": "MINOR:BROKER-VO+CH",
   "bank_id": [
    null,
    "CH"
   ],
   "bank_entry_state": "None+admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": [
    null,
    "ep003_line19"
   ],
   "vo_ref": "GAP:MINOR:BROKER-VO(no bank entry) / CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "新户，陆——叫陆先生。",
   "est_sec": 2.6,
   "shot_window_s": 2,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": [
    "needs-manual-split"
   ]
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L10",
   "shot_n": 10,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "它在洗盘，不是崩盘。洗盘，洗的就是人心。",
   "est_sec": 4.0,
   "shot_window_s": 8,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L11",
   "shot_n": 11,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "没……没了？又回来了？！",
   "est_sec": 2.9,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L12",
   "shot_n": 12,
   "speaker_role": "XIONGWEI",
   "bank_id": "XIONGWEI",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep002_line12",
   "vo_ref": "XIONGWEI/XIONGWEI[admitted]",
   "emotion": "tense",
   "text": "爹，有人在底部接我们砸的货。手笔……不像散户。",
   "est_sec": 5.5,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L14",
   "shot_n": 14,
   "speaker_role": "MINOR:CROWD",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:MINOR:CROWD(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "股神！明天买啥？",
   "est_sec": 1.9,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L15",
   "shot_n": 15,
   "speaker_role": "XIONG",
   "bank_id": "XIONG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line06",
   "vo_ref": "XIONG/XIONG[admitted]",
   "emotion": "cold",
   "text": "好胆识。可惜——联华，不是你能碰的。",
   "est_sec": 4.3,
   "shot_window_s": 2,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L16",
   "shot_n": 16,
   "speaker_role": "CH",
   "bank_id": "CH",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line19",
   "vo_ref": "CH/CH[admitted]",
   "emotion": "calm",
   "text": "谢谢熊先生的洗盘，替我把带血的筹码都洗便宜了。",
   "est_sec": 5.5,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L18",
   "shot_n": 18,
   "speaker_role": "XIONG",
   "bank_id": "XIONG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line06",
   "vo_ref": "XIONG/XIONG[admitted]",
   "emotion": "sad",
   "text": "他像一个人。一个我以为已经死了的人。",
   "est_sec": 4.3,
   "shot_window_s": 2,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP002-L19",
   "shot_n": 19,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "narration",
   "text": "明天，真正的仗才开始。",
   "est_sec": 2.2,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OK",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP003-L01",
   "shot_n": 1,
   "speaker_role": "NARRATOR",
   "bank_id": null,
   "bank_entry_state": null,
   "bank_ref_clip": null,
   "vo_ref": "GAP:NARRATOR(no bank entry)",
   "emotion": "tense",
   "text": "一个星期，三成仓，翻了一倍半。这口气，我等了十年。",
   "est_sec": 5.0,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP003-L02",
   "shot_n": 2,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "翻倍了！闺女的嫁妆翻倍了！",
   "est_sec": 3.1,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP003-L03",
   "shot_n": 3,
   "speaker_role": "RED",
   "bank_id": "RED",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line04",
   "vo_ref": "RED/RED[admitted]",
   "emotion": "crisp",
   "text": "观众朋友们，散户大厅今天出了个新人。",
   "est_sec": 4.3,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP003-L04",
   "shot_n": 4,
   "speaker_role": "RED",
   "bank_id": "RED",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep003_line04",
   "vo_ref": "RED/RED[admitted]",
   "emotion": "question",
   "text": "昨天底部全仓的，是不是您？您怎么看联华实业？",
   "est_sec": 5.2,
   "shot_window_s": 3,
   "fit": "OVERFLOW",
   "flags": []
  },
  {
   "line_id": "EP003-L05",
   "shot_n": 5,
   "speaker_role": "MANCANG",
   "bank_id": "MANCANG",
   "bank_entry_state": "admitted-interim",
   "bank_ref_clip": "ep001_line12",
   "vo_ref": "MANCANG/MANCANG[admitted-interim]",
   "emotion": "joy",
   "text": "他就是股神！我是他唯一的合伙人——",
   "est_sec": 4.0,
   "shot_window_s": 4,
   "fit": "TIGHT",
